About pets -- the real solution is to make friendly animals unhittable,
period.  It is dumb that they should be to begin with.  Make it so that
if you try to walk where the pet is, the pet trades squares with you
(or moves out of your way to random adjacent square, if possible).

You might want to disallow this for people with large (polymorphed) pets.

One other thing, I want the option of owning a penguin.  Calling my dog
Opus just isn't the same thing.

